        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to the <strong>Browse MCP</strong> documentation site!</p>
<p>Browse MCP is a Python-based MCP server that makes academic paper search easy and accessible through Claude and other MCP-compatible clients.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Jy_3" id="what-is-browse-mcp">What is Browse MCP?<a href="https://linxueyuan.online/browse-mcp/docs/blog/welcome#what-is-browse-mcp" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to What is Browse MCP?" title="Direct link to What is Browse MCP?" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Browse MCP provides three main tools:</p>
<ol>
<li class=""><strong>paper_search</strong> - Search papers across 19+ academic databases</li>
<li class=""><strong>paper_download</strong> - Download paper PDFs</li>
<li class=""><strong>paper_read</strong> - Extract and read text content from papers</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Jy_3" id="getting-started">Getting Started<a href="https://linxueyuan.online/browse-mcp/docs/blog/welcome#getting-started" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Getting Started" title="Direct link to Getting Started" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>Install Browse MCP with pip:</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_RTyb theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_tOHq"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_DO72 thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_nHeo"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">pip </span><span class="token function" style="color:#d73a49">install</span><span class="token plain"> browse-mcp</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Then start the MCP server:</p>
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_RTyb theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_tOHq"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_DO72 thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_nHeo"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">browse-mcp</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Check out our <a class="" href="https://linxueyuan.online/browse-mcp/docs/docs/intro">documentation</a> to learn more!</p>]]></content>
